# Sibling QuarkLang projects, each with its own repository, live directly in this workspace.
# They are not part of this repository and must not be tracked here.
QuarkLangLibs-*/
QuarkLangNpm/
QuarkLangPlayground/
QuarkLangQk*/
QuarkLangQuark/

# Local Go workspace: wires the sibling checkouts above into one build while the parser and this
# repository change together. Per-machine state, never tracked — CI and consumers always build the
# revision pinned in go.mod.
go.work
go.work.sum
